                                <div class="col-12">
                                    <ul class="list-style-04">
                                        <li>Optical port (IEC 62056-21)</li>
                                        <li>Dual RS485 ports with RJ45 terminals enable reliable digital communication and system integration.</li>
                                        <li>PLC+RF (G3/PRIME V1.4)</li>
                                        <li>3G / 4G / NB-IOT</li>
                                        <li>DLMS/COSEM compliant.</li>
                                        <li>Modular plug-and-play communication unit.</li>
                                        <li>Remote firmware upgrade capability</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Security & Interface -->
