                                            <li>STS-compliant token-based recharge</li>
                                            <li>Supports Multi step tariff structure</li>
                                            <li>Friendly mode with configurable holidays and intervals</li>
                                            <li>Real-time balance, overdraft, and consumption tracking</li>
                                            <li>Remote recharge and tamper-triggered relay control</li>
                                            <li>Card-based operations: User, Function, Collection</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Dimensions -->
                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="dimensions">
